The texts in laws/, ordinances/, statutory-instruments/, alderney/ and sark/ are secondary copies from FAOLEX, the legislative database of the Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations (https://faolex.fao.org), reused for a non-commercial purpose with acknowledgement of FAO (FAO terms of use: https://www.fao.org/contact-us/terms/en/). The underlying legislation is that of the States of Guernsey, the States of Alderney and the Chief Pleas of Sark.
